{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53794","headline":"登西山望硖石湖 · 白居易","name":"登西山望硖石湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菱歌清唱棹舟回，树里南湖似鉴开。\n平障烟浮低落日，出溪路细长新苔。\n居民地僻常无事，太守官闲好独来。\n犹忆长安论诗句，至今惆怅独书台。\n（见《海昌胜蹟志》卷三。\n同书引秦瀛语，谓疑出後人附会。\n此诗承陶敏先生录示。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}